OL,3,GNEWSARegeneration work at housing
OL,4,Aestate begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction for a new housing estate
OL,7,Fin Newark has started, councillors have
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FLast month Newark and Sherwood District
OL,11,FCouncil said the first phase of work to
OL,12,Fdemolish old houses and build more than
OL,13,F200 homes on the Yorke Drive estate was
OL,14,Fset to start.
OL,16,FThe plans - which also include a new
OL,17,Fsports pavilion and pitches - were
OL,18,Fapproved in February 2025.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
